    "title": "Golden Apple Winner: Sharon Fossom - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stacy Steinhagen ,\n1 days ago MANKATO, Minn. (KEYC) - Meet our latest Golden Apple recipient, Special Education teacher Sharon Fossom. Sharon runs Spirit of the Season, a Gibbon Fairfax Winthrop community organization that ensures working families have something under the Christmas tree every season. Mrs. Fossom has been doing it for twenty years and she explains why she continues to help people in need during the holidays. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
